sequenceDiagram
actor Staff as "Admin/Operator"
participant UI as "Interface: UI"
participant API as "mainController: Controller"
participant Delivery as "deliveryService: Service"
participant Ship as "shipmentService: Service"
participant DB as "PostgreSQL: Database"
Staff->>UI: Assign driver and vehicle to shipment
UI->>+API: PATCH /api/v1/shipments/{id}/assignment
API->>Delivery: validateAndAssign()
Delivery->>DB: Save same-warehouse assignment snapshot
Staff->>UI: Confirm shipment issue
UI->>+API: POST /api/v1/shipments/{id}/issue
API->>Ship: confirmIssue(idempotencyKey, version)
Ship->>DB: Recheck readiness and reservation
alt Ready
    Ship->>DB: Decrease OnHand and Reserved once
    Ship->>DB: Mark shipment Dispatched and order when all shipments issued
    API-->>-UI: Dispatch confirmed
else Not ready or duplicate
    API-->>-UI: Blocked/existing result
end

